    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day Train is a \u201cwork background game\u201d designed to help you stay focused while working or studying.<br>With its soothing, minimalist design and a UI optimized for productivity, it helps reduce the stress of daily tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Constantly Changing Real-Time Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background scenery in Day Train continuously evolves in real time.<br>The view from the window is automatically generated, ensuring that you never get bored, even during long sessions.<br>Additionally, the in-game time syncs with real-world time, offering new visual experiences throughout the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A UI Designed for Productivity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes built-in task management and timer features.<br>It not only provides a relaxing atmosphere but also actively supports your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Sounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The background music in Day Train can be customized by adding music files from your local PC, allowing you to create the perfect ambiance for concentration.</p>",
